        "heading_style": "display",
        "text": "<p>We are used to seeing tag lines, slogans, and even bible verses on clothing everywhere today.  Those can all be good things.  Conviction is a brand where we want designs that make people think.  Make them pause, process, observe – make them ask questions or evoke emotion.  Our goal is ultimately to spread Christ’s message by initiating a response, an opportunity for a conversation.</p><p>True growth is not through religion, true growth happens in relationship.  Conviction aims to build on initiating responses that open the door for relationships.</p>",
